BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 720 Td (SYNTHETIC EXAMPLE - NOT A REAL TECHNOLOGY) Tj T* () Tj T* (Compact Radiator Panel for Small Satellites: Test Report) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Background) Tj T* (Earlier studies showed that loop heat pipes can cool small spacecraft.) Tj T* (The project targets TRL 6 by the end of 2027.) Tj T* (This report covers the radiator panel component only.) Tj T* ET
