BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 720 Td (2. Thermal vacuum test) Tj T* () Tj T* (A flight-like radiator panel was built from aluminium honeycomb with embedded heat pipes.) Tj T* (The panel was tested in a thermal vacuum chamber from -40 C to +85 C over 12 cycles.) Tj T* (Measured heat rejection was 41 W at 20 C, within 3 percent of the analytical prediction.) Tj T* (All acceptance criteria in the test plan were met, with no leaks or degradation.) Tj T* ET
endstream
